    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_20:FEV_Town_06Zol_20_006:ce12ce1a",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_20",
        "key": "FEV_Town_06Zol_20_006",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_20:FEV_Town_06Zol_20_006:ce12ce1a",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_20:FEV_Town_06Zol_20_006:ce12ce1a",
        "jp_sha256": "ec40f0b3a2fa763ec7f5c4a13001ac35e9b7ac773c70c186928e46f2926535e8",
        "official_en_sha256": "add439a5683971770bf89e137fe9a652d82839ad6603b0863d23bbce87b42588"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "これからゾルダードも、\r\nシエラ様のもとでいい国になっていくだろう。",
        "official_en": "Yeah? Well, with Emperor Shera now leading us, Zoldaad is going to be a nation we can be proud of, too.",
        "real_en": "Zoldaad will surely become a better country\r\nunder Shera-sama's rule."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_20",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "兵士",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0022",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_20/FEV_Town_06Zol_20_006"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_20:FEV_Town_06Zol_20_067:5b088c37",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_20",
        "key": "FEV_Town_06Zol_20_067",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_20:FEV_Town_06Zol_20_067:5b088c37",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_20:FEV_Town_06Zol_20_067:5b088c37",
        "jp_sha256": "63058677b36289ad37ebf1c846de3d2a6d6f50f32ea8948fc983498bbb4b6e0a",
        "official_en_sha256": "1b0d2bc87cd7f7e3df25ecee7bbb83f2d11bc6fc011b9900025b2614d46ea0fd"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だからって、民への傲慢な態度が\r\n正当化されるわけじゃないけどな。",
        "official_en": "But that was no excuse to treat civilians the way I did, though.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
