        "official_en_sha256": "08531a05f83a616ab8428efe65d09fcd5add559334ba3739e5e69369b3ce6739"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "まったく……迷惑な話だよ。\r\nあんたらも目を付けられないように気をつけろよ。",
        "official_en": "Talk about a nuisance, eh? You lot ought to be careful, too. Trust me when I say you really don’t want to end up on their bad side.",
        "real_en": "What a nuisance... Be careful not to draw the soldiers' attention yourselves."
      },
      "review": {
