      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ゾルダードは元々不毛の地でさ。\r\n人々は点々と住んでいて、\r\nすごく不便な土地だったんだ。",
        "official_en": "Zoldaad used to be a barren land. Its people were scattered all over the continent without much in the way of...well, anything.",
        "real_en": "Zoldaad was originally barren land. People lived scattered far apart, and it was a terribly inconvenient place."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_FEV_Town_06Zol_20",
