      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "久しぶりに、旅行に来たんだけど……。\r\nなんだか兵士も多いし、目つきも鋭くないか？",
        "official_en": "Finally got some vacation time, so I came here to Zoldaad...but what’s with all the soldiers? And why are they giving everyone the side-eye?",
        "real_en": "It's been a while since I took a trip, but... why are there so many soldiers? And why do they all look so stern?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
