      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "兵士を辞めて、鎧を脱ぐことにしたんだ。\r\nどこにでも行けそうなくらい身体が軽いよ。\r\n鉄道で旅にでも出ようかな。",
        "official_en": "I’ve decided to hang up my armor and quit the military. I can go anywhere now... Maybe I’ll take a long overdue trip by train.",
        "real_en": "I've quit the military and taken off my armor. I feel so light I could go anywhere. Maybe I'll take a trip by train."
